silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_02_typing_law_sections_04_sous_observation_role_concrete_anchor_6 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 04_sous_observation_role #6', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Sous: The Under-Reading Observation Role' the bare symbol left(Hom(-,Mittens),,Hom(Mittens,-)right) anchors to MittensVetRecordBackendTarget: The backend write target: the storage row where the typed measurement claim lands after routing — the row carries source key, value, date, observer, gate status.." .
